{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1125118-wolf-raven-how-to-build-rune-caster","id":1125118,"title":"[Wolf & Raven] How to build Rune Caster?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-08-04T23:23:16-07:00","id":1125118,"title":"[Wolf & Raven] How to build Rune Caster?","content":"In my Viking chronicle, I have Bone Shadow Ithaeur player. She likes 'dead things curiosity' of Bone Shadows and plays 'priestess' on our Viking raids. She also have <i>Rune Caster</i> Merit and we found out there are a bit problems in using it by my quick read of <b>WtF</b> 2E corebook.<br /> <br /> For ease of referance, I will quote Merit from <i>Wolf &amp; Raven</i> Dark Era here.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dark Eras 1, p. 163</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>RUNE CASTER (\u2022\u2022)</b><br /> <b>Prerequisite:</b> Occult 2<br /> <b>Effect: </b>Your character is known for her ability to read runestones, divining the path of fate and the will of the old gods. By incorporating and casting the stones in her rituals, the character gains +2 on rolls for the Clairvoyance, Medium, or Omen Sensitivity Merits, interpreting a Cahalith\u2019s Prophetic Dreams (not necessarily her own) or using the Gift of Insight. This bonus may apply to other appropriate <br /> powers or abilities at the Storyteller\u2019s discretion.<br /> Additionally, the physical theatre of these readings can place social or religious pressures on those they relate to. After consulting the runestones on a given subject, treat onlookers\u2019 Impression of you as one step better while convincing them of your prophecy, whether your assessment is genuine or not.<br /> <b>Drawback:</b> While the use of this Merit does not constitute seidr, it can draw suspicion of such practices. Using it in a predominantly Christian environment can provoke accusations of sorcery and demon-worship.</div> </div> </div> </div>Now problem is that Gift of Insight is not very much 'I will fortel your future' - it's much more like vampires Auspex Discipline - and to use classical 'I will cast a runes to see will of the gods' scene character need to be Cathalith to have Prophetic Dreams. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/confused.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Confused\" smilieid=\"10\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Am I missing something? Maybe some official <b>WtF</b> 2E power that character could take?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-05T00:00:03-07:00","id":1125122,"title":"","content":"I think you need to reread the Gift of Insight (especially the Glory Honor, and Wisdom Facets), and the Rune Caster description that says the Cahalith dreams don't have to be the Rune Caster's own.<br /> <br /> Rune Caster (as it applies to Uratha-specific powers) is less about reading the future years from now, and more about knowing what's going to happen soon and making the best choices.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-05T00:11:17-07:00","id":1125123,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Bunyip</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1125118-wolf-raven-how-to-build-rune-caster?p=1125122#post1125122\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Rune Caster (as it applies to Uratha-specific powers) is less about reading the future years from now, and more about knowing what's going to happen soon and making the best choices.</div> </div> </div> </div>I see from Facets you pointed too as I re-read them now - I will better advise player when to use Runes then with RAW.<br /> <br /> But on last session we wanted to recreate 'ominous prophecy of Volva' scene in play, like from <b>13th Warrior</b> - seems appropriate to character having Merit like Rune Caster, but mechanics not working with this idea. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/confused.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Confused\" smilieid=\"10\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ciUd0f5Xjos\" data-code=\"ciUd0f5Xjos\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/ciUd0f5Xjos/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 08-05-2017, 03:15 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}